nts, and qualified-person restrictions.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;solar-9\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;microinverter &amp;amp; optimizer systems\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Electrical\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;10. Microinverter &amp;amp; Optimizer Systems&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Electrical&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;chev\&quot;&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Pro Recommended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$$ High&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Map each module-level device to its physical module position.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mount devices using approved hardware and required clearances.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Connect module leads without mixing incompatible connectors.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Secure trunk/branch cabling and protect unused connectors with approved caps.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Complete gateway/communications setup and device discovery.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Compare the digital array map with actual rooftop placement before closing the project.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field rule:&lt;/b&gt; Solar PV can remain electrically energized in daylight, and rooftop work adds serious fall hazards. Follow the approved design, manufacturer instructions, adopted electrical/building/fire rules, utility requirements, and qualified-person restrictions.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;solar-10\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(th