ermissions, and manufacturer prerequisites are complete.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Establish the required safe-work boundary and PPE/procedure for electrical testing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Follow the manufacturer-defined energization sequence.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Verify expected operating status, voltage/current data, communications, and production.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Test required safety and shutdown functions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Save baseline commissioning data for future troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field rule:&lt;/b&gt; Solar PV can remain electrically energized in daylight, and rooftop work adds serious fall hazards. Follow the approved design, manufacturer instructions, adopted electrical/building/fire rules, utility requirements, and qualified-person restrictions.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;solar-17\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;low production &amp;amp; underperformance diagnosis\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Diagnostics\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;18. Low Production &amp;amp; Underperformance Diagnosis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Diagnostics&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;chev\&quot;&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$ Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Compare current production with weather, season, array orientation, and the system baseline.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review inverter/gateway alarms and module-level monitoring if available.&lt;/li&gt;&