ice\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Thermal\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;17. EV Cooling System Service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Thermal&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;chev\&quot;&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$ Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Identify separate loops for battery, inverter, motor, cabin heater, or onboard charger.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use only the specified coolant and service equipment.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Inspect pumps, valves, hoses, reservoirs, radiators, chillers, and heater circuits.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Follow the required vacuum-fill or bleed process to prevent trapped air.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Confirm circulation and temperature response with scan data.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Never open a hot or pressurized cooling system.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EV safety rule:&lt;/b&gt; High-voltage EV systems can remain hazardous even when the vehicle appears off. Use OEM shutdown procedures, rated PPE/test equipment, and qualified-person restrictions. Never bypass interlocks, contactors, insulation monitoring, or battery protections.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;ev-17\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;heat pump &amp;amp; ev hvac diagnosis\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;HVAC\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;18. Heat Pump &amp;amp; EV HVAC Diagnosis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;HVAC&lt;/small&g