span&gt;DIY: Pro Recommended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$$ High&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Keep people away from the vehicle if there is smoke, popping, hissing, heat, or battery damage.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Identify HV battery location and visible intrusion or deformation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Follow emergency-response and OEM isolation guidance before handling.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not tow, lift, store, or charge the vehicle as if it were a conventional car without checking EV-specific restrictions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Monitor suspect battery packs according to facility/emergency protocols.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Route damaged high-voltage systems to trained personnel and appropriate storage/repair locations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EV safety rule:&lt;/b&gt; High-voltage EV systems can remain hazardous even when the vehicle appears off. Use OEM shutdown procedures, rated PPE/test equipment, and qualified-person restrictions. Never bypass interlocks, contactors, insulation monitoring, or battery protections.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;ev-19\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;pre-purchase used ev inspection\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Inspection\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;20. Pre-Purchase Used EV Inspection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Inspection&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;chev\&quot;&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$ Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review battery warranty status, recall history, charging history if available, and recent service records.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check displayed range versus conditions, not as a standalone battery-health verdict.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Test AC and DC charging where practical.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scan for persistent or recently cleared EV-system faults.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Inspect tires, brakes, suspension, cooling systems, charge inlet, underbody, and battery enclosure for damage.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use a model-specific battery-health evaluation before paying a premium for claimed battery condition.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EV safety rule:&lt;/b&gt; High-voltage EV systems can remain hazardous even when the vehicle appears off. Use OEM shutdown procedures, rated PPE/test equipment, and qualified-person restrictions. Never bypass interlocks, contactors, insulation monitoring, or battery protections.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;ev-20\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;footer&gt;Educational field reference. Not a substitute for OEM service information, EV certification, qualified high-voltage work, electrical permits, or emergency-response procedures.&lt;/footer&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;&lt;script&gt;\nlet currentCat='ALL';\nfunction toggleGuide(b){b.closest('.guide').classList.toggle('open')}\nfunction filterCat(c){currentCat=c;applyFilters()}\nfunction applyFilters(){\n let q=document.getElementById('search').value.toLowerCase();\n document.querySelectorAll('.guide').forEach(g=&gt;{g.style.display=((currentCat==='ALL'||g.dataset.cat===currentCat)&amp;&amp;g.dataset.title.includes(q))?'block':'none'})\n}\nfunction saveProgress(el){localStorage.setItem(el.dataset.id,el.checked?'1':'0');updateProgress()}\nfunction updateProgress(){\n let n=0;document.querySelectorAll('.done input').forEach(x=&gt;{if(x.checked)n++});\n document.getElementById('progress').textContent=n+'/20 Complete';\n}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.done input').forEach(x=&gt;{x.checked=localStorage.getItem(x.dataset.id)==='1'});updateProgress();\n&lt;\/script&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&quot;}, {&quot;emoji&quot;: &quot;🏠&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Roofing&quot;, &quot;file&quot;: &quot;tradestack-premium-roofing-v1.html&quot;, &quot;html&quot;: &quot;&lt;!doctype html&gt;&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=\&quot;utf-8\&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=\&quot;viewport\&quot; content=\&quot;width=device-width,initial-scale=1\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;title&gt;TradeStack Premium — Roofing v1&lt;/title&gt;&lt;style&gt;\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#05070d;color:#edf3ff;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:920px;margin:auto;padding:18px}\n.hero{padding:22px;border:1px solid #25324a;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0a1020,#10192c);margin-bottom:14px}.brand{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#75d8ff}\nh1{margin:6px 0 4px}.sub{color:#aebbd0;line-height:1.5}.stats,.tags{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px}.stat,.tags span{background:#162138;border:1px solid #2a3a58;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:13px}\ninput[type=search]{width:100%;padding:14px;border-radius:13px;border:1px solid #33435e;background:#0d1423;color:white;font-size:16px;margin:10px 0}.filters{display:flex;gap:7px;overflow:auto;padding:4px 0 12px}.filters button{white-space:nowrap;background:#101a2c;color:#dce8ff;border:1px solid #2b3b57;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 11px}\n.guide{border:1px solid #263550;background:#0b1220;border-radius:16px;margin:10px 0;overflow:hidden}.head{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;text-align:left;background:none;color:white;border:0;padding:16px;font-size:15px}.head small{display:block;color:#7f93b5;margin-top:5px}.body{display:none;padding:0 16px 17px}.guide.open .body{display:block}li{margin:9px 0;line-height:1.45;color:#d6dfed}.warn{background:#24120d;border:1px solid #6b2d1c;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;line-height:1.45;color:#ffd1c4}.done{display:block;margin-top:14px;padding:11px;background:#101a2c;border-radius:12px}footer{color:#7f93b5;text-align:center;padding:24px 8px;font-size:12px}\n&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;wrap\&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=\&quot;hero\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;brand\&quot;&gt;TradeStack Premium&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;🏠 Roofing&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;sub\&quot;&gt;20 advanced field guides covering inspection, planning, shingles, waterproofing, flashing, ventilation, diagnostics, and low-slope systems.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;stats\&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;stat\&quot;&gt;20 Guides&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;stat\&quot;&gt;Premium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;stat\&quot; id=\&quot;progress\&quot;&gt;0/20 Complete&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;\n&lt;input id=\&quot;search\&quot; type=\&quot;search\&quot; placeholder=\&quot;Search Roofing guides…\&quot; oninput=\&quot;applyFilters()\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;filters\&quot;&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('ALL')\&quot;&gt;All&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Diagnostics')\&quot;&gt;Diagnostics&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Flashing')\&quot;&gt;Flashing&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Inspection')\&quot;&gt;Inspection&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Low Slope')\&quot;&gt;Low Slope&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Planning')\&quot;&gt;Planning&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Replacement')\&quot;&gt;Replacement&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Safety')\&quot;&gt;Safety&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Shingles')\&quot;&gt;Shingles&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Structure')\&quot;&gt;Structure&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Ventilation')\&quot;&gt;Ventilation&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Waterproofing')\&quot;&gt;Waterproofing&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;roof safety, access &amp;amp; fall protection\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Safety\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Roof Safety, Access &amp;amp; Fall Protection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Safety&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;chev\&quot;&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Pro Recommended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$ Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assess weather, slope, edge exposure, roof condition, access, and overhead hazards before climbing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use a stable access system and fall protection appropriate to the work and applicable rules.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Keep the work zone below clear of people and unsecured materials.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not work on wet, icy, excessively hot, damaged, or otherwise unsafe surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plan material staging so loads do not create trip or structural hazards.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Stop work when conditions exceed the crew&amp;#x27;s equipment, training, or safe-access capability.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Roofing safety rule:&lt;/b&gt; Falls are a primary hazard. Use appropriate fall protection and safe access, follow manufacturer instructions and adopted building requirements, and route structural, electrical, severe storm, and specialized membrane work to qualified professionals.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;roof-1\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;roof inspection &amp;amp; damage assessment\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Inspection\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Roof Inspection &amp;amp; Damage Assessment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Inspection&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;chev\&quot;&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Inspect from the ground first, then use safe access only when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Document covering condition, flashing, penetrations, drainage, ventilation clues, and visible deck problems.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Trace damage patterns rather than assuming the nearest visible defect is the cause.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Photograph and mark suspect areas for repair planning.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check interior/attic evidence when accessible and safe.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Separate cosmetic wear from active water-entry or structural concerns.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Roofing safety rule:&lt;/b&gt; Falls are a primary hazard. Use appropriate fall protection and safe access, follow manufacturer instructions and adopted building requirements, and route structural, electrical, severe storm, and specialized membrane work to qualified professionals.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;roof-2\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;roof measurement, squares &amp;amp; material takeoff\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Planning\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Roof Measurement, Squares &amp;amp; Material Takeoff&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Planning&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;chev\&quot;&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Measure roof planes, pitch, ridges, hips, valleys, eaves, rakes, and penetrations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Convert roof area to squares and include appropriate waste for geometry and product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build a material list for covering, underlayment, flashing, fasteners, ventilation, and accessories.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plan tear-off disposal, delivery, staging, weather protection, and crew access.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Verify product compatibility and manufacturer installation requirements.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Confirm permit, inspection, and local code requirements before work begins.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Roofing safety rule:&lt;/b&gt; Falls are a primary hazard. Use appropriate fall protection and safe access, follow manufacturer instructions and adopted building requirements, and route structural, electrical, severe storm, and specialized membrane work to qualified professionals.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;roof-3\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&