ton&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Repair')\&quot;&gt;Repair&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('SMAW')\&quot;&gt;SMAW&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Safety')\&quot;&gt;Safety&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Structural')\&quot;&gt;Structural&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('TIG')\&quot;&gt;TIG&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;welding safety, ppe &amp;amp; hot-work setup\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Safety\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Welding Safety, PPE &amp;amp; Hot-Work Setup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Safety&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Remove combustibles and identify fire, fume, electrical, cylinder, and confined-space hazards.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use appropriate eye/face, hand, body, hearing, and respiratory protection for the process.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Provide ventilation/fume control suitable for the base metal, coating, consumable, and work area.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Secure cylinders upright and protect regulators, hoses, and valves.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Inspect leads, torch/gun, work clamp, machine, and surroundings before energizing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Maintain fire watch/extinguishing capability where the work requires it.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hot-work rule:&lt;/b&gt; Welding and cutting create fire, electrical, UV/IR radiation, compressed-gas, hot-metal, and fume hazards. Coated metals and confined spaces can be especially dangerous. Use appropriate ventilation/PPE and app