y repairs require qualified procedures and personnel.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;weld-2\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;flux-core / fcaw setup &amp;amp; fundamentals\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;FCAW\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Flux-Core / FCAW Setup &amp;amp; Fundamentals&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;FCAW&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$ Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Confirm whether the wire is self-shielded or gas-shielded and use its specified polarity.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Match wire diameter and machine capability to material thickness and position.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Clean heavy contamination and establish good electrical return.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set voltage/wire speed from consumable guidance, then test on scrap.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use travel angle and technique appropriate to the wire and position.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Remove slag between passes and inspect for trapped slag or incomplete fusion.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hot-work rule:&lt;/b&gt; Welding and cutting create fire, electrical, UV/IR radiation, compressed-gas, hot-metal, and fume hazards. Coated metals and confined spaces can be especially dangerous. Use appropriate ventilation/PPE and applicable hot-work controls; critical structural, pressure, lifting, vehicle-frame, and unknown-alloy repairs require qualified procedures and personnel.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class