;&lt;li&gt;Use an appropriate qualified repair process for critical components.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Control preheat/interpass/post-weld requirements when specified.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not weld safety-critical castings, pressure parts, lifting devices, frames, or unknown alloys by guesswork.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hot-work rule:&lt;/b&gt; Welding and cutting create fire, electrical, UV/IR radiation, compressed-gas, hot-metal, and fume hazards. Coated metals and confined spaces can be especially dangerous. Use appropriate ventilation/PPE and applicable hot-work controls; critical structural, pressure, lifting, vehicle-frame, and unknown-alloy repairs require qualified procedures and personnel.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;weld-18\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;structural / load-bearing weld awareness\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Structural\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;19. Structural / Load-Bearing Weld Awareness&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Structural&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Pro Recommended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$$ High&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Determine whether the weld is governed by an engineered design, welding code, procedure specification, or inspection requirement.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not change joint geometry, filler classification, weld size, or process without authorization.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use qualified welders/procedures where required.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Maintain traceability and inspection access for critical work.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Recognize that a visually attractive bead does not prove structural adequacy.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Route load-bearing uncertainty to the engineer, welding supervisor, or qualified inspector.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hot-work rule:&lt;/b&gt; Welding and cutting create fire, electrical, UV/IR radiation, compressed-gas, hot-metal, and fume hazards. Coated metals and confined spaces can be especially dangerous. Use appropriate ventilation/PPE and applicable hot-work controls; critical structural, pressure, lifting, vehicle-frame, and unknown-alloy repairs require qualified procedures and personnel.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;weld-19\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;final weld inspection &amp;amp; fabrication quality check\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Inspection\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;20. Final Weld Inspection &amp;amp; Fabrication Quality Check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Inspection&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Clean the weld enough to see toes, face, starts, stops, crater, and surrounding material.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check for visible cracks, porosity, overlap, undercut, arc strikes, incomplete fill, and excessive profile.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Verify dimensions, weld location, length, and fabrication geometry against requirements.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use gauges or nondestructive examination when the specification requires them.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not accept critical work solely because the bead looks smooth.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Document defects and repairs before coating or concealing the weld.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hot-work rule:&lt;/b&gt; Welding and cutting create fire, electrical, UV/IR radiation, compressed-gas, hot-metal, and fume hazards. Coated metals and confined spaces can be especially dangerous. Use appropriate ventilation/PPE and applicable hot-work controls; critical structural, pressure, lifting, vehicle-frame, and unknown-alloy repairs require qualified procedures and personnel.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;weld-20\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;footer&gt;Educational field reference. Follow equipment/consumable instructions and applicable workplace, fire, ventilation, engineering, welding-code, and inspection requirements.&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;let currentCat='ALL';function toggleGuide(b){b.closest('.guide').classList.toggle('open')}function filterCat(c){currentCat=c;applyFilters()}function applyFilters(){let q=document.getElementById('search').value.toLowerCase();document.querySelectorAll('.guide').forEach(g=&gt;g.style.display=((currentCat==='ALL'||g.dataset.cat===currentCat)&amp;&amp;g.dataset.title.includes(q))?'block':'none')}function saveProgress(e){localStorage.setItem(e.dataset.id,e.checked?'1':'0');updateProgress()}function updateProgress(){let n=0;document.querySelectorAll('.done input').forEach(x=&gt;{if(x.checked)n++});document.getElementById('progress').textContent=n+'/20 Complete'}document.querySelectorAll('.done input').forEach(x=&gt;x.checked=localStorage.getItem(x.dataset.id)==='1');updateProgress();&lt;\/script&gt