quot;&gt;Inspection&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Lateral')\&quot;&gt;Lateral&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Openings')\&quot;&gt;Openings&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Planning')\&quot;&gt;Planning&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Quality')\&quot;&gt;Quality&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Repair')\&quot;&gt;Repair&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Roof')\&quot;&gt;Roof&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Safety')\&quot;&gt;Safety&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Structure')\&quot;&gt;Structure&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Walls')\&quot;&gt;Walls&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;structural framing safety &amp;amp; load-path awareness\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Safety\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Structural Framing Safety &amp;amp; Load-Path Awareness&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Safety&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Identify gravity loads, lateral loads, bearing points, openings, and temporary stability before changing framing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use fall protection, safe ladders/scaffolds, lifting methods, PPE, and guarded cutting tools.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Brace incomplete walls, trusses, and tall assemblies so they cannot rack or collapse.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not cut, notch, drill, relocate, or remove structural members without verified design limits.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Keep personnel clear of suspended or unstable framing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt