r')\&quot;&gt;Exterior&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('HVAC')\&quot;&gt;HVAC&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Inspection')\&quot;&gt;Inspection&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Life Safety')\&quot;&gt;Life Safety&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Mechanical')\&quot;&gt;Mechanical&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Planning')\&quot;&gt;Planning&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Plumbing')\&quot;&gt;Plumbing&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Safety')\&quot;&gt;Safety&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;commercial maintenance safety &amp;amp; daily site walk\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Safety\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Commercial Maintenance Safety &amp;amp; Daily Site Walk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Safety&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review site hazards, restricted areas, emergency exits, active contractors, and unusual conditions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wear task-appropriate PPE and establish barricades/signage where occupants could enter the work area.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Look for leaks, odors, unusual heat/noise, damaged electrical equipment, blocked exits, and trip hazards.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not enter energized, confined, roof, mechanical, or other restricted areas without required authorization/training.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Photograph and document deficiencies with exact location and severity.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Escalate immediate life-safety hazards rather than leaving them buried in a routine work order.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility rule:&lt;/b&gt; Commercial maintenance crosses multiple licensed and regulated trades. Use lockout/tagout, fall protection, occupant controls, manufacturer procedures, and qualified specialists where required. Never bypass fire/life-safety, electrical, gas, pressure, or machine safeguards.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;cm-1\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;preventive maintenance program setup\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Planning\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Preventive Maintenance Program Setup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Planning&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build an asset list with location, make/model, serial number, service interval, and responsible trade.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Separate inspection tasks from maintenance tasks that require shutdown or qualified personnel.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create recurring schedules based on manufacturer guidance, site conditions, and applicable requirements.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Standardize work-order notes, photos, parts, labor, readings, and completion status.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Track repeat failures so chronic problems become corrective projects instead of endless bandages.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review overdue PM items and high-risk assets routinely.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility rule