vice restrictions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Disconnect and control hazardous energy before servicing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Inspect accessible cords, plugs, seals, filters, drains, fasteners, and cleanliness.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use approved replacement parts and cleaning products.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not defeat guards, interlocks, thermal cutouts, or other protective devices.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Function-test equipment before returning it to occupants.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility rule:&lt;/b&gt; Commercial maintenance crosses multiple licensed and regulated trades. Use lockout/tagout, fall protection, occupant controls, manufacturer procedures, and qualified specialists where required. Never bypass fire/life-safety, electrical, gas, pressure, or machine safeguards.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;cm-17\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;pump, motor &amp;amp; bearing condition checks\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Mechanical\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;18. Pump, Motor &amp;amp; Bearing Condition Checks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Mechanical&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Pro Recommended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$$ High&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review equipment history and establish safe shutdown/lockout before hands-on inspection.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check for abnormal noise, vibration, heat, leakage, looseness, and coupling/belt condition.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Record condition trends rather than relying only on a single observation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use appropriate alignment, lubrication, and vibration practices for the equipment.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not reach around rotating equipment or remove guards while running unless an approved diagnostic procedure explicitly provides safe means.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Escalate bearing, shaft, electrical, or internal pump failures to the appropriate trade.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility rule:&lt;/b&gt; Commercial maintenance crosses multiple licensed and regulated trades. Use lockout/tagout, fall protection, occupant controls, manufacturer procedures, and qualified specialists where required. Never bypass fire/life-safety, electrical, gas, pressure, or machine safeguards.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;cm-18\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;facility water intrusion &amp;amp; leak investigation\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Diagnostics\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;19. Facility Water Intrusion &amp;amp; Leak Investigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Diagnostics&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$ Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Map where water appears, when it occurs, weather/process conditions, and what lies above or upstream.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Inspect roof/wall penetrations, plumbing, HVAC condensate, drains, windows, and exterior envelope logically.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use moisture observations and controlled tests rather than destructive guessing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Protect occupants and finishes while investigating.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Correct the source before repairing cosmetic damage.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Document the confirmed source, affected materials, drying/remediation needs, and repair.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility rule:&lt;/b&gt; Commercial maintenance crosses multiple licensed and regulated trades. Use lockout/tagout, fall protection, occupant controls, manufacturer procedures, and qualified specialists where required. Never bypass fire/life-safety, electrical, gas, pressure, or machine safeguards.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;cm-19\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;monthly facility inspection &amp;amp; pm closeout\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Inspection\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;20. Monthly Facility Inspection &amp;amp; PM Closeout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Inspection&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Walk a consistent route through exterior, roof-access areas, mechanical spaces, restrooms, common areas, exits, and utility rooms as authorized.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check open PM tasks and verify completed work actually corrected the condition.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Record meter/condition readings that are part of the facility&amp;#x27;s maintenance plan.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prioritize life safety, active leaks, electrical hazards, HVAC outages, and accessibility/egress issues.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Update asset records and create corrective work orders for unresolved deficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Close the inspection with a short risk-ranked facility summary.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility rule:&lt;/b&gt; Commercial maintenance crosses multiple licensed and regulated trades. Use lockout/tagout, fall protection, occupant controls, manufacturer procedures, and qualified specialists where required. Never bypass fire/life-safety, electrical, gas, pressure, or machine safeguards.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;cm-20\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;footer&gt;Educational field reference. Facility requirements, licenses, codes, manufacturer procedures, and employer safety programs control the actual work.&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;let currentCat='ALL';function toggleGuide(b){b.closest('.guide').classList.toggle('open')}function filterCat(c){currentCat=c;applyFilters()}function applyFilters(){let q=document.getElementById('search').value.toLowerCase();document.querySelectorAll('.guide').forEach(g=&gt;g.style.display=((currentCat==='ALL'||g.dataset.cat===currentCat)&amp;&amp;g.dataset.title.includes(q))?'block':'none')}function saveProgress(e){localStorage.setItem(e.dataset.id,e.checked?'1':'0');updateProgress()}function updateProgress(){let n=0;document.querySelectorAll('.done input').forEach(x=&gt;{if(x.checked)n++});document.getElementById('progress').textContent=n+'/20 Complete'}document.querySelectorAll('.done input').forEach(x=&gt;x.checked=localStorage.getItem(x.dataset.id)==='1');updateProgress();&lt;\/script&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&quot;}, {&quot;emoji&quot;: &quot;🌬️&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Ventilation &amp; Indoor Air Quality&quot;, &quot;file&quot;: &quot;tradestack-premium-ventilation-indoor-air-quality-v1.html&quot;, &quot;html&quot;: &quot;&lt;!doctype html&gt;&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=\&quot;utf-8\&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=\&quot;viewport\&quot; content=\&quot;width=device-width,initial-scale=1\&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;TradeStack Premium — Ventilation &amp; Indoor Air Quality v1&lt;/title&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#05070d;color:#edf3ff;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:920px;margin:auto;padding:18px}.hero{padding:22px;border:1px solid #25324a;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0a1020,#10192c);margin-bottom:14px}.brand{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.8px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#75d8ff}h1{margin:6px 0 4px}.sub{color:#aebbd0;line-height:1.5}.stats,.tags{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px}.stat,.tags span{background:#162138;border:1px solid #2a3a58;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:13px}input[type=search]{width:100%;padding:14px;border-radius:13px;border:1px solid #33435e;background:#0d1423;color:white;font-size:16px;margin:10px 0}.filters{display:flex;gap:7px;overflow:auto;padding:4px 0 12px}.filters button{white-space:nowrap;background:#101a2c;color:#dce8ff;border:1px solid #2b3b57;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 11px}.guide{border:1px solid #263550;background:#0b1220;border-radius:16px;margin:10px 0;overflow:hidden}.head{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;text-align:left;background:none;color:white;border:0;padding:16px;font-size:15px}.head small{display:block;color:#7f93b5;margin-top:5px}.body{display:none;padding:0 16px 17px}.guide.open .body{display:block}li{margin:9px 0;line-height:1.45;color:#d6dfed}.warn{background:#24120d;border:1px solid #6b2d1c;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;line-height:1.45;color:#ffd1c4}.done{display:block;margin-top:14px;padding:11px;background:#101a2c;border-radius:12px}footer{color:#7f93b5;text-align:center;padding:24px 8px;font-size:12px}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;wrap\&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=\&quot;hero\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;brand\&quot;&gt;TradeStack Premium&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;🌬️ Ventilation &amp; Indoor Air Quality&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;sub\&quot;&gt;20 advanced guides covering airflow, exhaust, whole-house ventilation, HRV/ERV systems, ducts, filtration, moisture, combustion safety, monitoring, and IAQ inspection.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;stats\&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;stat\&quot;&gt;20 Guides&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;stat\&quot;&gt;Premium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;stat\&quot; id=\&quot;progress\&quot;&gt;0/20 Complete&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;input id=\&quot;search\&quot; type=\&quot;search\&quot; placeholder=\&quot;Search Ventilation &amp; IAQ…\&quot; oninput=\&quot;applyFilters()\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;filters\&quot;&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('ALL')\&quot;&gt;All&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Airflow')\&quot;&gt;Airflow&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Assessment')\&quot;&gt;Assessment&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Combustion')\&quot;&gt;Combustion&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Ducts')\&quot;&gt;Ducts&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Exhaust')\&quot;&gt;Exhaust&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Filtration')\&quot;&gt;Filtration&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Inspection')\&quot;&gt;Inspection&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Moisture')\&quot;&gt;Moisture&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Monitoring')\&quot;&gt;Monitoring&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Safety')\&quot;&gt;Safety&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Ventilation')\&quot;&gt;Ventilation&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;ventilation &amp;amp; iaq safety fundamentals\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Safety\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Ventilation &amp;amp; IAQ Safety Fundamentals&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Safety&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Identify electrical, rotating-equipment, ladder/roof, contaminated-air, combustion, heat, and confined-space hazards.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use task-appropriate PPE and isolate equipment before opening powered components.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not disturb suspected asbestos, lead-containing materials, or significant microbial contamination without appropriate procedures.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Never use odor alone to declare air safe.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Treat carbon-monoxide alarms, combustion spillage, or strong fuel odors as urgent safety conditions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Escalate hazardous contaminants, combustion problems, major mold contamination, or inaccessible mechanical work.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;IAQ rule:&lt;/b&gt; Source control comes first. Ventilation and filtration cannot make an active combustion hazard, major moisture source, or hazardous contaminant harmless. CO alarms, fuel odors, combustion spillage, and significant contamination require immediate appropriate response.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;iaq-1\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot