ain, overflow, and surrounding penetrations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Recheck for slow leaks after the initial test.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Remodel rule:&lt;/b&gt; A beautiful finish cannot rescue bad rough-in work hiding behind it. Structural changes, new electrical circuits, regulated plumbing/gas work, and complex waterproofing must follow applicable permits, codes, manufacturer systems, and qualified-trade requirements.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;remodel-17\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;toilet installation &amp;amp; leak prevention\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Finish\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;18. Toilet Installation &amp;amp; Leak Prevention&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Finish&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$ Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Field workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Confirm shutoffs, seals, mounting surfaces, and manufacturer installation requirements before assembly.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use new approved seals/gaskets where appropriate rather than trusting compressed old ones.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tighten fittings to seal without damaging finishes or cracking fixtures.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Seal only locations intended to be sealed so designed drainage paths remain open.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Run water through each fixture and inspect supply, drain, overflow, and surrounding penetrations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Recheck for slow leaks after the initial test.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/