ure, roof, exterior, interior, electrical, plumbing, HVAC, moisture, life safety, and reporting.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;stats\&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;stat\&quot;&gt;20 Guides&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;stat\&quot;&gt;Premium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;stat\&quot; id=\&quot;progress\&quot;&gt;0/20 Complete&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;input id=\&quot;search\&quot; type=\&quot;search\&quot; placeholder=\&quot;Search Home Inspection…\&quot; oninput=\&quot;applyFilters()\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;filters\&quot;&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('ALL')\&quot;&gt;All&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Attic')\&quot;&gt;Attic&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Electrical')\&quot;&gt;Electrical&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Exterior')\&quot;&gt;Exterior&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Fundamentals')\&quot;&gt;Fundamentals&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('HVAC')\&quot;&gt;HVAC&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Interior')\&quot;&gt;Interior&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Life Safety')\&quot;&gt;Life Safety&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Moisture')\&quot;&gt;Moisture&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Plumbing')\&quot;&gt;Plumbing&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Reporting')\&quot;&gt;Reporting&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Roof')\&quot;&gt;Roof&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button onclick=\&quot;filterCat('Structure')\&quot;&gt;Structure&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;home inspection scope, safety &amp;amp; documentation\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Fundamentals\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Home Inspection Scope, Safety &amp;amp; Documentation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Fundamentals&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Inspection workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Define the inspection scope and limitations before beginning.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use a consistent route so major systems and accessible areas are not skipped.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Carry basic non-destructive inspection tools appropriate to the task.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Photograph both defects and identifying/context views.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not operate equipment that appears unsafe, shut down, damaged, or outside normal controls.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Separate observed condition from speculation and recommend specialist evaluation when needed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inspection rule:&lt;/b&gt; This is an educational visual-inspection reference, not a substitute for licensing, certification, local standards of practice, engineering, or specialist diagnostics. Do not dismantle or energize unsafe equipment merely to complete an inspection.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;inspect-1\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;exterior site, grading &amp;amp; drainage inspection\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Exterior\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Exterior Site, Grading &amp;amp; Drainage Inspection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Exterior&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Inspection workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Walk the property and observe grade, drainage, vegetation, hardscape, foundation perimeter, cladding, openings, and penetrations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Look for water paths, soil contact, erosion, settlement clues, damaged finishes, and failed sealant/flashing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check that exterior components generally shed water away rather than trap it.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Observe doors/windows for visible damage, operation issues, and moisture staining where accessible.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Avoid destructive probing or unsafe ladder/roof access.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Document location and likely consequence of each significant defect.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inspection rule:&lt;/b&gt; This is an educational visual-inspection reference, not a substitute for licensing, certification, local standards of practice, engineering, or specialist diagnostics. Do not dismantle or energize unsafe equipment merely to complete an inspection.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;inspect-2\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;foundation &amp;amp; structural warning signs\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Structure\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Foundation &amp;amp; Structural Warning Signs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Structure&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Pro Recommended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Inspection workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Observe accessible foundation, framing, floors, walls, and openings for cracking, displacement, sagging, rotation, or unusual modification.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Distinguish minor finish cracking from patterns that may indicate movement.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Look for cut/notched framing, damaged engineered members, unsupported openings, and altered load paths.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check whether symptoms repeat across multiple building levels or components.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not declare structural adequacy from a visual inspection alone.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Recommend qualified structural evaluation for significant movement, damage, or uncertain alterations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inspection rule:&lt;/b&gt; This is an educational visual-inspection reference, not a substitute for licensing, certification, local standards of practice, engineering, or specialist diagnostics. Do not dismantle or energize unsafe equipment merely to complete an inspection.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;inspect-3\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;roof covering &amp;amp; flashing inspection\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Roof\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Roof Covering &amp;amp; Flashing Inspection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Roof&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $$ Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Inspection workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Inspect from a safe accessible location using ground/binocular, eave, ladder-edge, or roof access only when conditions permit.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Observe covering condition, flashing, penetrations, valleys, drainage, edges, and visible repairs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Look for missing/damaged materials, exposed fasteners, ponding clues, deteriorated sealants, and improper transitions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Correlate roof observations with attic/interior moisture clues.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not walk steep, wet, fragile, icy, excessively hot, or otherwise unsafe roofs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Document limitations when portions cannot be safely inspected.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inspection rule:&lt;/b&gt; This is an educational visual-inspection reference, not a substitute for licensing, certification, local standards of practice, engineering, or specialist diagnostics. Do not dismantle or energize unsafe equipment merely to complete an inspection.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;inspect-4\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;attic structure, insulation &amp;amp; ventilation inspection\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Attic\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. Attic Structure, Insulation &amp;amp; Ventilation Inspection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Attic&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Inspection workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Enter only when access, structure, temperature, electrical conditions, and clearance are reasonably safe.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Observe framing, roof deck, insulation, ventilation, exhaust ducts, moisture staining, and visible wiring.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Look for altered trusses/rafters, compression or gaps in insulation, blocked vents, and bathroom exhaust terminating improperly.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check for condensation, active leakage clues, and microbial-like growth without claiming laboratory identification.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Avoid stepping between framing members or disturbing hazardous materials.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Photograph defects and note inaccessible areas.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inspection rule:&lt;/b&gt; This is an educational visual-inspection reference, not a substitute for licensing, certification, local standards of practice, engineering, or specialist diagnostics. Do not dismantle or energize unsafe equipment merely to complete an inspection.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;inspect-5\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;exterior walls, siding &amp;amp; trim inspection\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Exterior\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;6. Exterior Walls, Siding &amp;amp; Trim Inspection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Exterior&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Inspection workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Walk the property and observe grade, drainage, vegetation, hardscape, foundation perimeter, cladding, openings, and penetrations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Look for water paths, soil contact, erosion, settlement clues, damaged finishes, and failed sealant/flashing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check that exterior components generally shed water away rather than trap it.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Observe doors/windows for visible damage, operation issues, and moisture staining where accessible.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Avoid destructive probing or unsafe ladder/roof access.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Document location and likely consequence of each significant defect.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inspection rule:&lt;/b&gt; This is an educational visual-inspection reference, not a substitute for licensing, certification, local standards of practice, engineering, or specialist diagnostics. Do not dismantle or energize unsafe equipment merely to complete an inspection.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;inspect-6\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;windows, doors &amp;amp; exterior openings inspection\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Exterior\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;7. Windows, Doors &amp;amp; Exterior Openings Inspection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Exterior&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Caution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Inspection workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Walk the property and observe grade, drainage, vegetation, hardscape, foundation perimeter, cladding, openings, and penetrations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Look for water paths, soil contact, erosion, settlement clues, damaged finishes, and failed sealant/flashing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check that exterior components generally shed water away rather than trap it.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Observe doors/windows for visible damage, operation issues, and moisture staining where accessible.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Avoid destructive probing or unsafe ladder/roof access.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Document location and likely consequence of each significant defect.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inspection rule:&lt;/b&gt; This is an educational visual-inspection reference, not a substitute for licensing, certification, local standards of practice, engineering, or specialist diagnostics. Do not dismantle or energize unsafe equipment merely to complete an inspection.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;inspect-7\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;interior walls, ceilings &amp;amp; floors inspection\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Interior\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;8. Interior Walls, Ceilings &amp;amp; Floors Inspection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Interior&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Medium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: Normal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Inspection workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Operate normal doors/windows/fixtures where safe and observe walls, ceilings, floors, cabinets, counters, and finishes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Look for moisture stains, movement cracks, loose materials, trip hazards, damaged glazing, a