d handrails for obvious looseness, missing components, and unsafe geometry.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use moisture measurement only to support an observation, not as proof of the source.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Note cosmetic issues separately from safety or system defects.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Trace repeated interior symptoms to likely exterior, plumbing, HVAC, or structural sources.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;warn\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inspection rule:&lt;/b&gt; This is an educational visual-inspection reference, not a substitute for licensing, certification, local standards of practice, engineering, or specialist diagnostics. Do not dismantle or energize unsafe equipment merely to complete an inspection.&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;label class=\&quot;done\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; data-id=\&quot;inspect-9\&quot; onchange=\&quot;saveProgress(this)\&quot;&gt; Mark guide complete&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;guide\&quot; data-title=\&quot;electrical service &amp;amp; panel inspection awareness\&quot; data-cat=\&quot;Electrical\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;button class=\&quot;head\&quot; onclick=\&quot;toggleGuide(this)\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;10. Electrical Service &amp;amp; Panel Inspection Awareness&lt;/b&gt;&lt;small&gt;Electrical&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;＋&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;div class=\&quot;body\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;tags\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;DIY: Pro Recommended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Difficulty: Advanced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost: $ Low&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Safety: High Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Inspection workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Observe service equipment and accessible electrical components without exceeding inspection qualifications.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Look for missing covers, damaged enclosures, overheating clues, corrosion, improper openings, and obvious unsafe modifications.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Test accessible receptacles and protective 